{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2008-common-biology-10","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2008,"subject":"biology","number":10,"points":null,"unitId":"gene","unitLabel":"분자생물학·유전자 발현","topic":"DNA·유전자발현·히스톤","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["gene","cell"],"stem":"DNA 가닥과결합하는히스톤의변형(modification)에따라\n유전자발현이조절된다. 그림은뉴클레오솜구성성분중하나인\n히스톤H3의N-말단리신의아세틸화상태를나타낸것이다.\n이에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 응축된염색질에서는리신이탈아세틸화되었다.\nㄴ. 아세틸화된히스톤H3는염색질의활성화에기여한다.\nㄷ. 이부위에있는리신과DNA 가닥의결합은공유결합이다.\nㄹ. 리신이탈아세틸화되면히스톤H3와DNA 가닥의결합력이\n강화된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":[]},{"number":5,"text":"","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":[]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":737,"height":155,"region":0,"bbox":[16.856,71.766,294.8,62.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-common-biology-10/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":779,"height":271,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,180.966,311.6,108.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2008-common-biology-10/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":5,"sourceRect":[82.744,746.234,416.5,1068.587],"width":333.756,"height":322.353,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[16.856,71.766,294.8,62.0],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,180.966,311.6,108.4],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"10. DNA 가닥과결합하는히스톤의변형(modification)에따라","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.995],"spans":[{"text":"10.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,16.401,11.995],"origin":[5.0,14.596],"size":11.687,"flags":0,"font"